emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic与Akamai签署18亿美元计算协议以强化算力基础设施</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic 发布 AI 模型 Mythos，引发全球金融与科技行业网络安全恐慌</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任！百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵发布万亿级思考模型Ring-2.6-1T，支持推理强度自定义</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/936b6437efdd29a49714e24ba3a44d45.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵正式发布万亿级旗舰思考模型Ring-2.6-1T，该模型专为Agent工作流、工程开发及科研分析等复杂生产环境设计。核心亮点在于引入Reasoning Effort机制，支持high与xhigh两种推理强度模式，允许开发者根据任务需求平衡推理成本与执行效率。在性能评测中，high模式在PinchBench取得87.60分，优于GPT-5.4xHigh等竞品；xhigh模式在AIME26与GPQA Diamond分别达到95.83分和88.27分。该模型的发布标志着大模型竞争转向推理效能的精细化运营。目前，Ring-2.6-1T已上线OpenRouter提供限时一周免费体验，并计划近期正式开源，旨在推动AI智能体在企业级工作流中的常态化落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布 Codex for Chrome 扩展，实现浏览器自动化操作与复杂任务处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1369a0e2f6721d1d08dab97a43d25f6e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月7日，OpenAI 正式推出 Codex for Chrome 扩展程序，标志着 AI 助手从对话框迈向浏览器深度交互。该插件通过获取用户授权，能够直接驱动 Chrome 浏览器，执行阅读网页、操作内部系统及填写复杂表单等任务，充当“数字员工”角色。实测显示，Codex 在处理简单任务时偶尔存在识别偏差，但在信息搜集、生成创作选题、调用 Deepseek 辅助撰稿及自动化制作报表等复杂、多步骤任务中表现出极高的生产力。目前，该工具定位为“半自动助手”，在网页元素精准识别上仍有优化空间。官方建议用户在处理非敏感日常工作时使用，涉及核心隐私或高安全要求的任务仍需人工全程监看与复核。这一模式的落地，预示着 AI 与互联网信息的交互方式正迎来深度变革。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic与Akamai签署18亿美元计算协议以强化算力基础设施</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/586ea7f7c8e46311aad7a53a6bebca82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日与云服务商Akamai达成价值18亿美元的计算协议，旨在通过获取关键计算资源，满足其生成式AI模型日益增长的训练与推理需求。受此消息影响，Akamai股价一度上涨28%。此次合作标志着Anthropic在基础设施建设上的进一步多元化，通过多方布局构建底层算力护城河。对于深耕CDN与边缘计算的Akamai而言，该协议是其向高性能计算领域转型的关键里程碑。近期Anthropic动作频频，此前已传出与SpaceXAI达成算力合作，并正洽谈价值15亿美元的合资协议。这一系列密集投资反映了当前AI行业激烈的算力军备竞赛，同时也显示出老牌云服务商正通过绑定顶级AI初创公司，重新定义其在AI基础设施市场的竞争定位与话语权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic 发布 AI 模型 Mythos，引发全球金融与科技行业网络安全恐慌</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d31c874a40da853b25b61f2dbfa23f9f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic 正式推出 AI 模型 Mythos，该模型具备挖掘全球软件基础设施中数千个未知安全漏洞的能力，引发全球金融机构、科技巨头及政府部门的广泛焦虑。为规避潜在风险，Anthropic 采取限量发布策略，仅向苹果、亚马逊等少数大型企业开放。Anthropic CEO 达里奥・阿莫代伊表示，此举旨在应对 AI 驱动的网络犯罪威胁。然而，网络安全公司 watchTowr Labs 指出，Mythos 的漏洞检测能力与现有模型并无本质差异，行业恐慌更多源于企业漏洞修复速度滞后于 AI 攻击节奏。此次发布加剧了 Anthropic 与 OpenAI 在网络安全领域的竞争，后者近期已推出 GPT-5.5-Cyber 模型。专家强调，尽管技术在进步，但针对关键基础设施的勒索软件攻击风险依然严峻，企业需加速防御体</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任！百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/70374cfff6c7bc6aef17e3d45cd1ac21.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI“幻觉”也得负法律责任。百度因AI生成虚假侵权信息被判道歉AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 9, 202628近日，一起涉及人工智能生成内容（AIGC）名誉侵权的案件引发社会广泛关注。江苏南京的执业律师李小亮在利用百度平台搜索自身姓名时发现，该平台运营的“AI智能回答”竟给出了惊人回复。系统错误地声称“李小亮律师被判处有期徒刑三年”，并在此类虚假文字旁公然配发了李小亮身着律师袍的职业照片。这种无中生有的“AI幻觉”不仅严重失实，更直接损害了职业律师的社会声誉与形象。法院判决：技术进步并非侵权的“挡箭牌” 面对侵权指控，百度方面曾辩称，AI产生的“幻觉”或错误内容是目前技术领域难以预见且无法完全避免的现象。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
